Walk scalars:
```python
def walk(node, path=()):
    if isinstance(node, dict):
        for k,v in node.items(): yield from walk(v, path+(str(k),))
    elif isinstance(node, list):
        for i,v in enumerate(node): yield from walk(v, path+(f'[{i}]',))
    elif isinstance(node, str):
        yield ('.'.join(path), node)
```

